//
// The prefill's GEMM array (aie2_prefill.py) at 2 layers on NPU2: a layer's
// projections (qkv, o, g, u, d) for 64 rows each from the decode's weight
// blob, every output row bit-exact to the numpy oracle
// (llama_oracle.Layer.project). --synthetic-weights swaps the layers'
// weights for seeded ones in the same layout.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, xrt_python_bindings
//
// RUN: %run_on_npu2% %python %S/test_prefill_gemm.py --synthetic-weights --n-layers 2 --iters 0 | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: first dispatch: 2 layers x qkv o g u d, 64 rows each, every row bit-exact: PASS
